Tue Oct 20 13:24:31 UTC 2026 - Thomas Muntaner <tmuntaner@suse.com>

- Version 0.1.0-alpha18
- Replace Okta with authentik (breaking change):
  * log in through authentik's flow executor API, with TOTP and WebAuthn
    (USB security keys) as MFA methods
  * the okta-aws and okta-aws-sso subcommands and provider names are now
    authentik-aws and authentik-aws-sso; the app url is the SAML
    application's .../sso/binding/init/ url
  * remove the --mfa-provider flag and Okta Push
  * okta_aws_hosts and okta_aws_sso_hosts settings are ignored, not migrated
  * saved passwords are asked for again, the keyring entry is keyed on the
    identity provider's domain

